    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-18T15:55:43+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-18T15:55:43+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-18T05:25:43Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-18T05:25:43Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A slow-moving high pressure system over the Tasman Sea extends a ridge over eastern SA. A trough of low pressure over WA will move eastwards into western SA late Sunday and reach southeastern parts later Monday, while a weakening cold front crosses the Bight. The trough lingers in the east through the middle of the week as a weak high pressure system forms in the Bight. This trough weakens on Thursday as a second trough moves into the west from WA.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW009" description="Flinders" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-18T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-19T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-18T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-18T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. Winds northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-19T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-20T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-18T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-19T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower near the coast in the morning and early afternoon. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm west of the ranges in the late morning and early afternoon. Winds northeasterly 25 to 35 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 12 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 26 to 31.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">No Rating</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:20am to 4:40pm, UV Index predicted to reach 9 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-20T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-21T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-19T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-20T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers. A thunderstorm likely, possibly severe with damaging winds, large hail and heavy rain which may lead to flash flooding in the morning and afternoon. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h in the morning then tending northeast to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 14 and 18 with daytime temperatures reaching 26 to 31.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-21T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-20T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-21T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning and afternoon. Winds south to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 16 with daytime temperatures reaching around 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-22T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-21T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. The chance of morning fog on and east of the ranges. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly during the morning then tending east to northeasterly during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 12 and 16 with daytime temperatures reaching around 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
